# Companion Strapi version pin for this drop-in kit.
#
# This directory is NOT a runnable Strapi app (no package.json). Assemble into a
# real Strapi project — preferably create-strapi-app@5.37.0 — or use the
# companion griswold-strapi repo, then overlay/copy strapi/src + strapi/config.
#
# Required floor: Strapi >= 5.37.0 (docs/03-Technical-Spec.md §2.1).
# Recommended pin for reproducible access-control green: 5.37.0
#
# Note: newer minors (e.g. 5.50.x) hard-reject the legacy v4 query key
# `publicationState`. AC-24 is version-tolerant (200 OR safe 4xx), but pinning
# 5.37.0 keeps local/CI behavior aligned with the reviewed companion.
#
# STRAPI_VERSION=5.37.0
STRAPI_MIN=5.37.0
STRAPI_PIN=5.37.0
